#! ia 1.0

@distribution ia-approval-distribution
  meaning
    says "The release root of the public IA approval base kit: approval-system with the approver, approval-rule, docket and approval words, their canonical schemas and authoring guides, intake recognition and seal rules, and the offline check-seal verifier."
    answers "Which records does the IA approval kit release ship?"
  distribution
    records [@system approval-system]
